data/life_signals.db
data/life_signals.db-shm
data/life_signals.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
# keep small baselines, but ignore large runtime artifacts

# NOTE: local_user/, foundation_models/, src/data/ and model
# artifacts (*.pt, *.cbm, *.csv) are COMMITTED on purpose — the pre-trained
# baselines must ship with the repo so every clone works without
# retraining (~1h per cohort).

